        "chars": 578,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.46
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        348,
        1629,
        1542,
        1826
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Please advise Diane Trainor, the Director of the Citywide Occupational and Health Office, of the name of your designee and your plans for achieving compliance and, of course, do not hesitate to contact her if you require assistance. Her office is located at 11 Park Place; her telephone number is (212) 566-1515.",
